  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civic youth activism and international partnerships in Moldova</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ob&#x10d;iansky aktivizmus ml&#xe1;de&#x17e;e a medzin&#xe1;rodn&#xe9; partnerstv&#xe1; v Moldavsku</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Hlavn&#xfd;m cie&#x13e;om projektu je posilni&#x165; ob&#x10d;iansky aktivizmus ml&#xe1;de&#x17e;e prostredn&#xed;ctvom anga&#x17e;ovania v mimovl&#xe1;dnom sektore a posilni&#x165; ob&#x10d;iansku spolo&#x10d;nos&#x165; ako relevantn&#xe9;ho akt&#xe9;ra v diskusii o veciach verejn&#xfd;ch. Dobrovo&#x13e;n&#xed;k bude zapojen&#xfd; do aktiv&#xed;t hostite&#x13e;skej organiz&#xe1;cie, ktor&#xe1; prostredn&#xed;ctvom vzdel&#xe1;vac&#xed;ch aktiv&#xed;t podporuje n&#xe1;rast ob&#x10d;ianskej particip&#xe1;cie a aktivizmu ml&#xe1;de&#x17e;e, ako aj rozvoj demokratick&#xfd;ch zru&#x10d;nost&#xed; v miestnych komunit&#xe1;ch. Dobrovo&#x13e;n&#xed;k sa bude takisto zameriava&#x165; na pr&#xed;pravu a organiz&#xe1;ciu tr&#xe9;ningov pre ml&#xe1;de&#x17e;, workshopov pre mlad&#xfd;ch l&#xed;drov, asistenciu pri organizovan&#xed; vzdel&#xe1;vac&#xed;ch aktiv&#xed;t alebo bude akt&#xed;vne propagova&#x165; mo&#x17e;nosti neform&#xe1;lneho vzdel&#xe1;vania v Moldavsku a v zahrani&#x10d;&#xed;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main objective of the project is to strenghten civic youth activism through engagement in non-governmental sector and to support civil society as a relevant actor in discussion on public affairs. Volunteer will be involved in activities of receiving organization, which through education activities supports growth of civil participation and youth activism, but development of democratic skills in local communities as well. The volunteer will also focus on preparation and organization of various trainings for youth, workshops for young leaders, assistence in organization of educational activities or he/she will be actively promote possibilities of informal education in Moldova and abroad.</narrative>
  </description>
